  "reasoning": "The defendant operated a health store and sold products that were identified by authorities as counterfeit medicines (假药). Under Chinese criminal law, the act of manufacturing or selling counterfeit drugs constitutes the crime of 生产、销售假药罪. No other criminal conduct is described in the facts, so only this charge applies.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]生产、销售假药<eoa>"
